---
// The reader's switch for reference markers (hub decision
// 2026-11-10-christianjmills-numbered-reference-markers). It sits with the contents: once in the
// aside, where the rail keeps it in view, and once under the page's head for a narrow screen. The
// stylesheet shows one of them and hides the markers while a box is unchecked, so the switch works
// without scripts; src/scripts/references.ts keeps the two boxes together and the choice.
---

<label class="refs-switch"><input type="checkbox" checked /> Show references</label>
